OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer 'persistently' tried to
OL,4,Acontact sex workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer would have been
OL,7,Fdismissed had he not resigned for being
OL,8,F"dishonest" and "persistently trying"
OL,9,Fto contact sex workers, a panel has
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FA two-day gross misconduct hearing at
OL,13,FLeicestershire Police's headquarters in
OL,14,FEnderby on Thursday heard a police
OL,15,Fofficer - who was granted anonymity by
OL,16,Fthe force - was accused of attempting
OL,17,Fto contact sex workers and being
OL,18,Fdishonest.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
