OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer 'persistently' tried to
OL,4,Acontact sex workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer told investigators they
OL,7,Flent their phone to someone they did
OL,8,Fnot know on a night out, which was why
OL,9,Fcalls were made to escorts, the hearing
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe panel concluded the officer - who
OL,13,Fhas resigned - would have been
OL,14,Fdismissed without notice and would be
OL,15,Fplaced on the police's barred list.
